","author":"悠閒過日子(jangshow)","title":"●note","time":1053274452,]),(["msg":"鍛筋銼骨(Body inprovement)
  每升一級所需
  exp = (50+sk_lv)*(50+sk_lv)*(50+sk_lv)*7
  聲望 = (50+sk_lv)*(50+sk_lv)
  coin = (50+sk_lv)*(50+sk_lv)*500
每一級增加 hp 5

內呼吸法(Inner breathe)
  每升一級所需
  exp = (60+sk_lv)*(60+sk_lv)*(60+sk_lv)*7
  聲望 = (60+sk_lv)*(60+sk_lv)
  coin = (60+sk_lv)*(60+sk_lv)*500
每一級增加 ap 3

精神調節(Spirit adjust)
  每升一級所需
  exp = (60+sk_lv)*(60+sk_lv)*(60+sk_lv)*7
  聲望 = (60+sk_lv)*(60+sk_lv)
  coin = (60+sk_lv)*(60+sk_lv)*500
每一級增加 mp 3

兵器大師(Weapon master) [exp 5000萬,聲望 1000]
  每升一級所需
  exp = (70+sk_lv)*(70+sk_lv)*(70+sk_lv)*7
  聲望 = (70+sk_lv)*(70+sk_lv)
  coin = (70+sk_lv)*(70+sk_lv)*500
裝備武器時,提升之攻擊力=(武器攻擊力)*(1+0.03*sk_lv)

精確攻擊(Accuracy attack)
  每升一級所需
  exp = (50+sk_lv)*(50+sk_lv)*(50+sk_lv)*7
  聲望 = (50+sk_lv)*(50+sk_lv)
  coin = (50+sk_lv)*(50+sk_lv)*500
每一級增加 0.02% 攻擊命中率

身形幻化(Illusive looking)
  每升一級所需
  exp = (50+sk_lv)*(50+sk_lv)*(50+sk_lv)*7
  聲望 = (50+sk_lv)*(50+sk_lv)
  coin = (50+sk_lv)*(50+sk_lv)*500
每一級增加 0.02% 閃躲迴避率

守護光壁(Protect shield)
  每升一級所需
  exp = (50+sk_lv)*(50+sk_lv)*(50+sk_lv)*7
  聲望 = (50+sk_lv)*(50+sk_lv)
  coin = (50+sk_lv)*(50+sk_lv)*500
每一級增加 0.5 防禦力

原力吸收(Force imbibe)
  每升一級所需
  exp = (50+sk_lv)*(50+sk_lv)*(50+sk_lv)*7
  聲望 = (50+sk_lv)*(50+sk_lv)
  coin = (50+sk_lv)*(50+sk_lv)*500
自然回復時,回復點數=原回復值*(1+0.03*sk_lv)
